    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_Payment Intent Cancellation API",
    "description": "The Payment Intent Cancellation API allows businesses to efficiently cancel pending payment intents. This API is primarily used to manage transaction states within their payment processing workflows, ensuring that users can halt transactions before completion. Typical consumers include e-commerce platforms and service providers needing to handle order modifications or customer service inquiries. By providing a straightforward cancellation mechanism, this API enhances user experience and operational flexibility.",
